  "pure_background_rule_zh": "场景 PNG 必须是纯背景插画：禁止对话框、HUD、小地图、菜单按钮、任务追踪、界面 mockup；无主角特写，远处匿名人群可。",
  "pure_background_rule": "Scene images must be pure painted environment backgrounds only. NO game UI overlays.",
  "ui_negative": "NO game UI, NO dialogue box, NO HUD, NO minimap, NO menu buttons, NO text overlay, NO speech bubble, NO interface elements, pure background illustration only"
